{
    "title": "Ticket\u00f3n - Event tickets",
    "description": "By using the Ticket\u00f3n App you will find the latest concerts, festivals, games, conferences, and more right in the palm of your hand.\r\n\r\nGet personalized event recommendations that you can share with your friends and family, and search thousands of events real-time. The Ticket\u00f3n bilingual App is the most convenient and easiest way to purchase your event tickets, movie tickets, and merchandise. \r\n\r\nYOUR PHONE IS YOUR TICKET\r\nNo paper required. Just pull up your tickets in the Ticket\u00f3n app or upload your seats to Apple Wallet, get them scanned at the gate, and head into your event. \r\nSee all your event info in one convenient place.\r\n\r\nNEVER MISS OUT ON AN EVENT\r\nGet alerts about your favorite events, artists, and venues.\r\n\r\nTRANSFER TO FRIENDS\r\nIt's super easy. Stop hand-delivering tickets or waiting at the entrance for everyone to arrive\r\nquickly transfer tickets to friends and meet them at your seats. Transfer your seats to friends and family for free\r\nWHO ARE WE?\u2028Ticketo\u0301n is a leading online platform that specializes in giving fans direct access to the best entertainment experiences. Consumers are able to purchase event tickets, movie tickets, and merchandise on our user-friendly bilingual website, app and by phone. \r\n\r\nDownload the Ticket\u00f3n app and go live.",
    "descriptionHTML": "By using the Ticket\u00f3n App you will find the latest concerts, festivals, games, conferences, and more right in the palm of your hand.<br><br>Get personalized event recommendations that you can share with your friends and family, and search thousands of events real-time. The Ticket\u00f3n bilingual App is the most convenient and easiest way to purchase your event tickets, movie tickets, and merchandise. <br><br>YOUR PHONE IS YOUR TICKET<br>No paper required. Just pull up your tickets in the Ticket\u00f3n app or upload your seats to Apple Wallet, get them scanned at the gate, and head into your event. <br>See all your event info in one convenient place.<br><br>NEVER MISS OUT ON AN EVENT<br>Get alerts about your favorite events, artists, and venues.<br><br>TRANSFER TO FRIENDS<br>It&#39;s super easy. Stop hand-delivering tickets or waiting at the entrance for everyone to arrive<br>quickly transfer tickets to friends and meet them at your seats. Transfer your seats to friends and family for free<br>WHO ARE WE?\u2028Ticketo\u0301n is a leading online platform that specializes in giving fans direct access to the best entertainment experiences. Consumers are able to purchase event tickets, movie tickets, and merchandise on our user-friendly bilingual website, app and by phone. <br><br>Download the Ticket\u00f3n app and go live.",
